0V11.2z'%3e%3c/path%3e%3c/g%3e%3cpath%20d='M249.7%2014.8v28h9v3.8h-22.5v-3.8h8.9v-28h-8.9v-3.7h22.4v3.7h-8.9z'%20fill-rule='nonzero'%3e%3c/path%3e%3cg%20fill-rule='nonzero'%3e%3cpath%20d='M268.6%2035.8l5-.8c1.2%205%205%208.5%2012.5%208.5%205.9%200%2010-1.7%2010-6.2%200-4-2.7-5.5-7.9-6.2l-7.8-1c-6.3-1-10.1-3.8-10.1-9.8%200-6.2%205.4-10.2%2014.6-10.2%208.7%200%2014.5%203.4%2016%2010.4l-4.9%201.2c-1.3-5-4.6-7.6-11.3-7.6-5.8%200-9.4%202.1-9.4%205.8%200%203.5%202%205.2%207.1%206l7.6%201c7%201%2011.1%203.7%2011.1%2010s-4.9%2010.7-15%2010.7c-10.5%200-16.1-4.5-17.5-11.8zM340%2042.5v4h-27.2V11.2h26.8v4h-22v11.2h21.1v4.1h-21v12H340z'%3e%3c/path%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/svg%3e",contrast:true,description:"Humanise AI logo"},{img:"/_app/immutable/assets/factmata.CiEqAUw5.svg",contrast:true,description:"Factmata logo"},{img:"/_app/immutable/assets/wns.__KwET6d.png",contrast:true,description:"WNS logo"}],tweets:[{name:"Anastasios Nikolas Angelopoulos",handle:"ml_angelopoulos",link:"https://twitter.com/ml_angelopoulos/status/1925288220360909286",content:"We love \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span>. \u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>It helped us scale to our first million users. Amazing and undervalued that Gradio can do this.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>cc \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@_akhaliq\u003C/span>",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/4sbu_-Af_400x400.DW_rEXau.jpeg"},{name:"Jaydeep",handle:"_jaydeepkarale",link:"https://x.com/_jaydeepkarale/status/1639978163643252736",content:"Gradio was love at first sight..so easy to use",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/NLkT5L7d_400x400.DXR6GVP1.jpeg"},{name:"Will Rice",handle:"_Will_Rice",link:"https://twitter.com/_Will_Rice/status/1430258610131582979",content:"Just tried out \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span> and I am very impressed. Only took like 10mins to put together a \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">#tts\u003C/span> demo.",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/LsCnjnsl_400x400.DcgBvVAx.jpeg"},{name:"Art Litvinau",handle:"ArtLitvinau",link:"https://x.com/ArtLitvinau/status/1678937099343364097",content:"I love how easy is to build quick prototypes with \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span> ⚡️ this one took me 45 minutes with no previous experience with the library",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/lpJQ2BrK_400x400.BusGsFlu.jpeg"},{name:"Shirochenko Dmitriy",handle:"dmshirochenko",link:"https://x.com/dmshirochenko/status/1924417517503627346",content:"Spent the weekend prototyping LLM interfaces directly in Python. \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@gradio\u003C/span>-app is a game changer for rapid UI development. Forget wrestling with JS/CSS; share your model in seconds. Thinking this unlocks serious iteration speed.",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/ADswb5-b_400x400.RVu4-7DR.jpeg"},{name:"iCode2",handle:"Ifeanyidiaye",link:"https://x.com/Ifeanyidiaye/status/1785948320596099111",content:"Apart from being very easy to use, one thing that I simply love about \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span> is its Javascript client, which makes it easy to build a nice HTML frontend for Python applications. This integration makes me rank gradio high in my list of favorite Python libraries.",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/d6sTU6ul_400x400.C3pqL2h4.jpeg"},{name:"Amar Saini",handle:"_Epoching_",link:"https://twitter.com/_Epoching_/status/1471091318482825219",content:"Just built a ️\u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span> app for a video related deep learning project. \u003Cbr> I’m astonished by how simple it is to use & how elegant it looks! Lots and lots of great features & flexibility. Thanks for making this ❤ ",profile_pic:"/_app/immutable/assets/pwMrDOBv_400x400.DU2ixqy9.jpeg"},{name:"Roxana Daneshjou MD/PhD",handle:"RoxanaDaneshjou",link:"https://twitter.com/RoxanaDaneshjou/status/1418399829944721415",content:"Honestly, without \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span>, we would not be doing a real time AI trial.  We have many other ideas for algorithms we want to test through clinical trials, and we know it's possible thanks to \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">@Gradio\u003C/span>.",profile_pic:"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},{name:"Vinay Prabhu",handle:"vinayprabhu",link:"https://twitter.com/vinayprabhu/status/1324409497641652225",content:"Dear \u003Cspan class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\">#MachineLearning\u003C/span> twitter,\u003Cbr>If you haven't typed: \u003Cbr>$ pip install gradio\u003Cbr>yet, now would be a damn good time.\u003Cbr>Especially if you are working in computer vision &amp; deploying models in the real world. ",profile_pic:"data:image/jpeg;base64,"}],star_count:43401},uses:{}}],
							form: null,
							error: null
						});
					});
				}
			</script>
